al campaigns. Real signed cases.</h2><p class=\"text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12\">Screenshots from live accounts, shared with permission.</p><div class=\"reveal card !p-6 lg:!p-8 mb-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted uppercase mb-3\">Google Ads, February 2026</p><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6\">$368K in one month. 2,354 people asked for help.</h3><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6\"><div><div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand\">$368K</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mt-1\">Monthly ad spend</div></div><div><div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand\">2,354</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mt-1\">Conversions</div></div><div><div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand\">11.8M</div><div class=\"text-xs text-text-muted mt-1\">Impressions</div></div></div><img alt=\"Google Ads MVA campaign performance, February 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"900\" height=\"500\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg border border-border-subtle w-full h-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1152px) 1088px, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fproof-google-ads.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"reveal card !p-6 lg:!p-8 mb-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted uppercase mb-3\">Weekly performance snapshot</p><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-