 that fails your agreed criteria is replaced free.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What about TCPA and consent?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every lead asked for a lawyer on a form they filled in themselves, verified their phone number by one-time passcode, and carries a TrustedForm certificate. You get the consent record with the lead. Anyone who opts out is removed for good.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who follows up on the lead?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every lead we deliver can be worked by PlaintiffPilot, our AI intake engine, so a lead gets its first text in under 60 seconds and is chased until it books or disqualifies. Ask about it on the call or see plaintiffpilot.com.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Pay per lead or a management fee?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Your choice. Pay per lead is a fixed price by state, and we walk you through it on the first call. The management fee option runs the same campaigns inside your own ad account for a flat monthly fee, so you own the account, the data and the spend.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the terms?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Exclusive to one firm per market, in writing. A pilot cap on the first batch, 50% prepayment per batch, a 7-day dispute window, a 20% replacement cap, and month to month after that.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What states do you cover?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every state except the ones where we already have an exclusive partner, and we tell you on the call.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase mb-4\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-12\">Common questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all border border-border-subtle bg-surface-raised